---
title: Online payment – VNPay (MF-05)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> PENDING : Client clicks Pay with VNPay
  PENDING --> PENDING : same fee clicked again in time (session reused)
  PENDING --> FAILED : session expired before callback
  PENDING --> PROCESSING : signed IPN / return claims the payment
  PROCESSING --> FAILED : VNPay reports cancelled or failed
  PROCESSING --> SUCCEEDED : fee recorded as PAID (VNPAY reference)
  PROCESSING --> NEEDS_REVIEW : money received but fee no longer payable
  PROCESSING --> PENDING : unexpected error, claim released for IPN retry
  SUCCEEDED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  NEEDS_REVIEW --> [*] : Platform Admin resolves
